<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – Secretsource</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/es/tags/secretsource/</link><description>Recent content in Secretsource on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>es</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/es/tags/secretsource/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>secretsource — un secreto desde una referencia</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/es/libraries/secretsource/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/es/libraries/secretsource/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;¿De dónde sale un PIN, cuando no debe quedar en un archivo?&lt;/strong&gt; Una&lt;strong&gt;referencia&lt;/strong&gt; dice dónde vive un secreto; &lt;code&gt;secretsource.Open&lt;/code&gt; lo trae. La
referencia no contiene ningún secreto, así que puede estar en una opción, un
script o el historial del shell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go get github.com/go-authn/secretsource@v0.3.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="¡Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;secretsource&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ctx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;defer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// overwrites the bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="¡Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Referencia&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Lee&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;file:PATH&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;un archivo regular legible solo por su propietario (modo 0600 o más estricto); se quita un salto de línea final&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keychain:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;un elemento de contraseña genérica del Llavero de macOS&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:SERVICE/ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;un elemento de Secret Service de freedesktop con atributos &lt;code&gt;service=SERVICE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;account=ACCOUNT&lt;/code&gt; (GNOME Keyring, KWallet, integración Secret Service de KeePassXC)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;secretservice:KEY=VALUE[,KEY=VALUE...]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;el único elemento de Secret Service con todos esos atributos; varias coincidencias se rechazan&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;la entrada de KeePassXC cuyo &lt;strong&gt;campo URL&lt;/strong&gt; es esa URL (&lt;code&gt;https://NOMBRE.invalid/...&lt;/code&gt; es una buena elección, que nunca se resuelve); dos entradas con la misma URL se rechazan por ambiguas&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-uuid/...&lt;/code&gt; y &lt;code&gt;keepassxc:by-path/...&lt;/code&gt; se &lt;strong&gt;rechazan&lt;/strong&gt;: KeePassXC
2.8.0 se cierra con un fallo cuando una búsqueda encuentra una entrada sin URL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ningún esquema ejecuta un comando&lt;/strong&gt;: una opción nunca debe poder iniciar un
proceso. Una referencia sin esquema se rechaza, no se adivina como ruta (&lt;code&gt;file:&lt;/code&gt;
es la forma de escribir una ruta). Un secreto de más de 4096 bytes, o vacío
desde un gestor, se rechaza, y una llamada termina con su contexto (2 minutos
sin plazo) aunque el gestor esté esperando que lo desbloquee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="keepassxc"&gt;KeePassXC&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="keepassxc"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#keepassxc" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Enlace permanente a esta sección"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;KeePassXC se alcanza por su protocolo de integración con el navegador, en macOS
y Linux; Windows aún no está implementado.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En KeePassXC, active &lt;em&gt;Settings &amp;gt; Browser Integration&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asocie esta máquina una vez por base de datos y apruébelo en KeePassXC:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-authn/secretsource/cmd/secretsource@latest
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource keepassxc associate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="¡Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cree la entrada y &lt;strong&gt;rellene su campo URL&lt;/strong&gt; con&lt;code&gt;https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&lt;/code&gt; (cualquier URL que ninguna otra entrada
use: la referencia es esa URL). Compruebe la referencia sin imprimir el
secreto:
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;secretsource check &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;keepassxc:https://fido.invalid/yubikey-5c&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="¡Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La primera lectura de una entrada muestra el diálogo de acceso de KeePassXC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lo usan &lt;code&gt;fido --pin-from&lt;/code&gt; (véase &lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/es/libraries/fido/"&gt;fido&lt;/a&gt;) y&lt;code&gt;theca --pin-from&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--password-from&lt;/code&gt; y &lt;code&gt;--recovery-from&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="reference"&gt;Referencia&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="reference"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#reference" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Enlace permanente a esta sección"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;El README de&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-authn/secretsource" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;github.com/go-authn/secretsource&lt;/a&gt; es
la fuente de verdad de esta página.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>